# Nothing reaches the image build unless it is named here: the config, the database and
# its copies, statements, output, personal rules, internal docs, tests and caches all stay
# out, and so does whatever is added to the folder later.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!src/**
!frontend
!frontend/**

# Inside src: what is not source.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
# Built in the image from frontend/, never taken from this folder.
src/scrooge/web/spa
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.svelte-kit

# Never, wherever they turn up.
**/scrooge.yaml
**/finanze.yaml
**/rules.yaml
**/rules.*.yaml
**/instruments.yaml
**/categories.yaml
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*

# Except the starter files `scrooge init` copies, which hold nothing personal.
!src/scrooge/starter/*.yaml
